@startuml component_diagram
title Solar Energy Prediction System - Component Diagram

[Streamlit UI] as UI

package "Backend API" {
  [FastAPI Routers] as API
  [Simulation Engine] as Engine
  [Weather Services] as Weather
}

cloud "Open-Meteo API" as External

UI --> API : HTTP Requests
API --> Engine : Calculate Production
API --> Weather : Fetch Data
Weather --> External : API Calls
Engine --> Weather : Get Weather
API --> UI : JSON Response

note right of Engine
  PV Physics:
  • Solar position & irradiance
  • Temperature effects
  • System losses
  • DC/AC conversion
end note

@enduml
